# Probe: Dwarven Mine played by a player who doesn't own it counts that player's Mountains (CR 614.12: "you" is the
# player it will enter under, CR 305.1). Bot1 mills Bot2's Dwarven Mine under Dauthi Voidwalker (exiled with a void
# counter), plays three Mountains, then plays the Mine from exile. Bot1 controls three other Mountains, Bot2 none: it
# enters untapped and makes a Dwarf for Bot1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Dauthi Voidwalker
Mox Sapphire
Thought Scour
Mountain
Mountain
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Dwarven Mine
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Dauthi Voidwalker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dauthi Voidwalker.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Dwarven Mine)
Bot1.Exile.Dwarven Mine.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
